Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.61,0:23:07.57,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k24\blur5}All {\k25}of {\k19}the {\k21}hopes {\k15}and {\k31}dreams {\k30}are {\k17}in {\k21}this {\k22}bro{\k23}ken {\k21}tam{\k12}bou{\k15}rine
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.70,0:23:11.41,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k48\blur5}Make {\k23}the {\k20}si{\k26}lent {\k21}tam{\k17}bou{\k24}rine {\k45}sing {\k25}like {\k19}how {\k16}it {\k31}used {\k21}to {\k34}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.75,0:23:14.66,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k23\blur5}Come {\k21}wit{\k22}ness {\k38}the {\k34}birth {\k41}of {\k24}the {\k24}great{\k20}est {\k19}lone{\k15}li{\k13}ness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.91,0:23:18.33,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k39\blur5}In {\k20}this {\k24}ho{\k23}llow {\k33}still{\k38}ness, {\k40}now {\k24}tell {\k22}me {\k18}what {\k19}will {\k24}you {\k17}choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:21.84,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k33\blur5}Dy{\k52}ing, {\k43}dy{\k46}ing, {\k45}dy{\k22}ing {\k21}or {\k47}liv{\k30}ing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.01,0:23:27.01,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k31\blur5}Dy{\k53}ing, {\k40}dy{\k53}ing, {\k36}dy{\k27}ing {\k25}or {\k48}liv{\k186}ing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.10,0:22:11.27,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Viaje por mil anos, nade pelas ondas
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.39,0:22:14.52,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Encontre meu corpo flutuando no tempo e no espaço
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.98,0:22:17.98,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}De uma terra tão selvagem e tão desolada
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.53,0:22:21.70,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Mais uma polegada, estarei alcançando o portão da lua
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.20,0:22:25.07,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Dentro e fora, respiro com o passar do tempo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.57,0:22:28.70,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Aqui hoje vem a sentença da minha vida
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.20,0:22:32.25,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Qual é a pergunta ardente que procura?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.62,0:22:37.21,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}O que exatamente você ainda quer de mim?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.17,0:22:43.05,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Pronto, pronto
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.38,0:22:44.97,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Veja como você é minúsculo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.14,0:22:46.68,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Veja como você é frágil
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.85,0:22:48.43,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Veja como você é indefeso
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.64,0:22:50.10,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Eu posso ver o que você é
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.47,0:22:53.39,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Por que você não pega minha mão, pega minha mão amiga?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.56,0:22:55.02,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Eu devo ser o herói
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.19,0:22:56.94,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Todos os olhos em mim, fortes e grandiosos
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.11,0:22:58.69,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Eu devo ser o maior
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.86,0:23:00.36,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Eu devo ser o salvador
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.44,0:23:02.28,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Todos os olhos em mim, aqui e agora
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.28,0:23:04.20,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Dizem que eu sou o messias deles
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.61,0:23:07.57,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Todas as esperanças e sonhos estão neste pandeiro quebrado
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.70,0:23:11.41,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Fazer o tamborim silencioso cantar como era antes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.75,0:23:14.66,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Venha testemunhar o nascimento da maior solidão
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.91,0:23:18.33,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Nesta quietude oca, agora me diga o que você vai escolher?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:21.84,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Morrer, morrer, morrer ou viver?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.01,0:23:27.01,ED2 Trad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur5}Morrer, morrer, morrer ou viver?
